   Hameed, Zahid, Prince Mohamed Bin Fahd Univ, Coll Business Adm, Dhahran, Saudi Arabia.
   Khan, Safeer Ullah; Khan, Manzoor Ahmad, Gomal Univ, Inst Business Adm, Dera Ismail Khan, Pakistan.},
