Abstract = {I am a poet, arts-based researcher and healthy relationships educator.
   After many years of teaching about healthy relationships in the
   classroom, and writing poetry about my relationships with people, I
   moved to Butterstone Farm and discovered a new place of learning.
   Through the Gates of Loving Inquiry(1) develops the conversation on how
   we may engage in loving relationships within and beyond the scope of our
   human relationships, expanding this pedagogical practice from the walls
   of schools and universities out toward our experience with nature.},
