Month = {JAN-APR},
Abstract = {With the grant was made a geoprocessing cartographic mapping of the
   geographical space of Garanhuns-PE, which was aimed at understanding the
   current spatial configuration of the landscape and its correlations with
   environmental degradation. Based on information from the office and
   field, was to identify which space is organized in an unsustainable
   manner. Soon there few preserved green areas within the city limits, the
   area of urban expansion is advanced into the valleys, flora remaining
   outside the urban landscape is of secondary forest and is being
   minimized because of the expansion of grazing and subsistence
   activities.},
